Subset of https://github.com/pytorch/rl/commit/6e18e35b2c68be1a56afebfb0676d217925114cd
holding only the tensordict 0.14 compatibility changes: `to_module` now keeps
`nn.Parameter`/buffer registrations by default, so the call sites that
deliberately deregister them must opt out with `preserve_module_state=False`.

